From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 12:17:41 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 276/333] [ae-patch] Add a conditional security reviewer slot
 to roles presets

A reviewer slot may carry when: risky and focus: security. The lead notice
lists such a slot in its numbered position with an explicit trigger list and
says to skip it, and merge the rest as usual, when the diff is not risky. The
web editor gets a runs select (not on Reviewer 1) and a focus select on every
slot, each with a hint. Slots without the fields render exactly as before.
